msgid ""
"This action term is designed specifically for controlling multirotor "
"vehicles by mapping action inputs to thruster commands. It provides "
"flexible preprocessing of actions through:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction:6 of
msgid ""
"**Scaling**: Multiply actions by a scale factor to adjust command "
"magnitudes"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction:7 of
msgid ""
"**Offset**: Add an offset to center actions around a baseline (e.g., "
"hover thrust)"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction:8 of
msgid "**Clipping**: Constrain actions to valid ranges to prevent unsafe commands"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction:10 of
msgid ""
"The action term integrates with Isaac Lab's "
":class:`~isaaclab.managers.ActionManager` framework and is specifically "
"designed to work with :class:`~isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor` "
"assets."
