msgid "Environment indices to reset. Defaults to None (all environments)."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.process_actions:3
#: of
msgid ""
"This method transforms raw policy actions into thrust commands through an"
" affine transformation followed by optional clipping. The transformation "
"is:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.process_actions:6
#: of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{processed} = \\text{raw} \\times \\text{scale} + \\text{offset}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.process_actions:9
#: of
msgid "If clipping is configured, the processed actions are then clamped:"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.process_actions:11
#: of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{processed} = \\text{clamp}(\\text{processed}, \\text{min}, "
"\\text{max})\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.process_actions:14
#: of
msgid ""
"Raw action tensor from the policy. Shape is ``(num_envs, action_dim)``. "
"Typically in the range [-1, 1] for normalized policies."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.process_actions:19
#: of
msgid ""
"The processed actions are stored internally and applied during the next "
":meth:`apply_actions` call."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.apply_actions:3 of
msgid ""
"This method sets the processed actions as thrust targets on the "
"multirotor asset. The thrust targets are then used by the thruster "
"actuator models to compute actual thrust forces during the simulation "
"step."
msgstr ""

#: isaaclab_contrib.mdp.actions.thrust_actions.ThrustAction.apply_actions:7 of
msgid ""
"The method calls "
":meth:`~isaaclab_contrib.assets.Multirotor.set_thrust_target` on the "
"multirotor asset with the appropriate thruster IDs."
msgstr ""

